content:
I for one am not opposed to the fees or can pass any judgement on whether they are too low or too high atm, and willing to see how they play out mid-term, at least until we have player crafting enabled. 

Perhaps a relevant question is the appropriate timing of the introduction of the fees. In the absence of game some are playing the marketplace with likely small margins. Fees introduced now will likely eliminate these "players" and may also reduce liquidity in current market as a result.

@SW4GN3R I am not asking for a date, but what milestone in the project do you think is appropriate to introduce marketplace fees? Showroom release, SCREAM release, ship crafting in SCREAM release, etc...?
